gh of questioned the veracity  of the FBI investigation though because  it has been so shortened because it has  been so restricted well I just find that  laughable as well because as we see here  it's a calculated campaign this was  something the Democrats were wanting  demanding a week ago we need an FBI  investigation well they got it they got  it and they don't like the results so  now it's no surprise well it wasn't long  enough it wasn't thorough enough I you  know this is not something that is  surprising to those of us here nothing  would be good enough because at the end  of the day what they want is to stop  judge Cavanaugh for gaining that seat on  the Supreme Court and I just hope and  I'm very confident now that that will  not happen we believe that he will be  seated and he will be a Justice of the  United States Supreme Court I just hope  for Brett and his family he is able to  wake up after the end of this weekend on  the sunrise side of the mountain
 

